          "evidence": ".agents/skills/ws-monitor/scripts/monitor_snapshot.cjs:L1139-L1159",
          "message": "Within-root correlation-first ordering only reorders the slice+1 name-sorted candidates that listTranscriptCandidates enumerates, so a path-correlated file beyond that stop in a large root is never collected (plan 2.3 bullet 3 intent partially defeated). AC10/AC11 binding fixtures (M1/M9) pass; reachability is a single/merged root with more than its slice of candidates where the target sorts late. Minimal correction: prioritize correlation during enumeration (pass keys into listTranscriptCandidates or collect correlated-path entries in a bounded pre-pass).",
